 "description": "Query the complete released NoCom rare-block extraction: 419 Overworld bedrock positions above Y4 and 39 End portal frame positions. Frames may be ordinary stronghold frames; these are blocks, not structures or full portals. Supply neither x/z to discover all records, or both for a native-coordinate circle of radius 1..8192. Optional kind bedrock or endPortalFrame, Y 0..255. Max 25 rows; follow nextOffset with unchanged filters. Dates are positive observation dates, not placement dates; replacements and survival were not checked. No Nether/End block coverage. Cite canonicalUrl and sourceJsonUrl; never infer ownership.",
